==Usage==
<code>csv.read</code> and <code>csv.from_page</code> will return generator objects that are easily iterated through a <code>for</code> loop.

<syntaxhighlight lang="lua">
local csv = require('Module:CSV')

local ex = [[name,page,dmg
cat,Cat (Normal Cat),3]]

for line in csv.read(ex) do
	mw.logObject(line)
end
</syntaxhighlight>
==Considerations==
Lua was not built for parsing CSV files. Don't use this module directly in an invokable module; if it is needed then make a data page and <code>mw.loadData</code> the data page in the invokable module.
}}